The '''Kuudra Believer''' is an [[NPC]] found on the [[Crimson Isle]], who asks for players to donate {{c}} if they believe in the return of [[Kuudra]]. They allow the player to obtain {{Item|Herring the Fish}} and the {{Item|Kuudra Follower Helmet}}, as well as access the {{NPCSprite|Weird Sailor}}.

== Quest ==
The '''Kuudra Believer''' will appear in the {{zone|plhlegblast pool}} after the [[player]] defeats [[Kuudra]] for the first time. Donated {{c}} will not get refunded.

Depending on the amount of donated coins and other conditions, different things will happen:

* If a player donates {{C|4202022}} while a {{MobSprite|Plhlegblast}} is within {{Yellow|3}} blocks, they will receive {{Item|Herring the Fish}}.
* If a player donates at least {{c|1m}} and enters {{zone|Kuudra's Hollow}} within {{Green|30}} minutes of donating the {{c}}, the {{NPCSprite|Weird Sailor}} will appear at {{Coordinates|-131|93|-177}}.
* If a player donates [[Kuudra Follower Armor#Calculator|a certain amount of coins]] once they have obtained the {{Item|Wet Napkin}}, as well as a {{MobSprite|Plhlegblast}} is within {{Yellow|3}} blocks of the NPC, they will receive a {{Item|Kuudra Follower Helmet}}.
